{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-05_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-05","title":"雖非同族","storyCode":"10-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"380c1159bc8aff5c8a1728dadfc885eeb5a87520b13f1ed91de40333b7deef2e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"費斯特帶領阿米婭等人來到自救軍地下據點，眾人結識自救軍指揮官克洛維希婭。蔓德拉向薩卡茲請罪，與曼弗雷德再次達成合作。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......回到倫蒂尼姆的第一百八十六天。\n又有三名士兵加入了我們。兩名受傷很重。只有羅本還能戰鬥。\n只在這一個區，就至少還有七十名士兵被困在敵人手裡。\n整個倫蒂尼姆都已淪陷。被俘士兵數量無法估計。\n我不知道他們是不是還活著。\n我更不知道是否該慶幸他們還活著。\n每天都有好不容易活下來的人永遠離開。我想記住他們每一個人的名字，但事實上，很多士兵在見到我的時候，甚至已經無法開口。\n我多希望能多一個人聽聽他們的聲音。我多麼希望......能有一個人在身邊聽聽我的聲音。\n但願你有一天能看到這些記錄。\n但願你在外面的任務還順利。\n但願你不要這麼快回到倫蒂尼姆......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，新來的幾個士兵已經安置好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你了，布萊克。暫時不要給他們安排任務，他們需要先適應兩天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角，我不用適應！我隨時都能出去殺敵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行。布萊克，把羅本編入四隊，正常輪班偵察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，號角。挺好的，最近深池又活躍了起來，我們正需要人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三隊還沒回來。羅本，你最好原地休息一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以做點別的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議你過來坐下。我們最多只有半個小時，別浪費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，我理解你的心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想出去對付敵人，是吧？你覺得早上那場仗還沒打夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我的手還在發抖！它希望我能再多握一會弓弩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅本，記住一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們待在這裡，不是為了多消滅幾個深池士兵，或者幾個薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的首要目的是活著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後是......讓更多我們的人也能活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白就好。抓緊休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您手裡的這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"備忘錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是隨手寫寫，不用太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得您說過，您有很長時間都是一個人行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪您會有這個習慣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......或許是做別人的隊長做久了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人聽我說話，總像是缺了點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也多虧了布萊克他們從深池手裡搶了這支筆，要不然我真是只能用小刀在下水管道上刻字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真的這麼做過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去最外面的排水層找找，你說不定能看到我親手刻下的《維多利亞，一段歷史》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅本","speakerId":"avg_npc_413_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......得刻上多久啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我開玩笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閒聊留給以後吧，深池的士兵隨時可能回到附近。我閉會眼，你也是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，深池的那個菲林術師來了，她說她想見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她沒有帶其他手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，她的源石技藝很難防備......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你眼裡，我連這種層次的源石技藝都對付不了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我絕對不會這麼想！將軍，你和特雷西斯將軍一樣，都是我最佩服的戰士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去你該去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在見過赦罪師的信使之後，你應該有了心理準備。有一項工作需要交給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我把從那艘船上來的人找出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾與他們共事過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是雇傭兵。雇傭兵從來不會特意記住共事過的每一個人，除非他的腦袋特別值錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對付熟人，總會容易些，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那名巴別塔的刺客已經身在中央城區。防備她是赦罪師們的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於其他人......赫德雷，你猜猜他們都有誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城內的雇傭兵還未發現他們之中任何一個的蹤跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們遲早會有所行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這半年以來，我們在維多利亞的眼線一直追蹤著那艘船的位置。但他們卻總能快我們一步，甚至能不被察覺地靠近倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得這是什麼原因？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一種可能性。他們在倫蒂尼姆有暗樁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗樁......是啊，暗樁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樁子恐怕在很多年前就已經插下，而且根基不淺。否則的話，一定很難逃過我們的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很合理。在我印象中，那位勳爵......那位醫生的手段難以估量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，把最近我們抓到的反抗者的底細都再仔細查一查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你懷疑我們已經抓到了人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果羅德島的人還在附近逗留，他們一定有不得不這麼做的理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"narration","text":"1:15 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，地下結構"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比爾，是我，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是你小子。我剛看到洛洛了，你們不是一起出任務了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，她有事先回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶的這些人......等等，薩卡茲？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別別別動手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們很可能就是指揮官在等的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......指揮官在等的難道不是幫手？既然是幫手，怎麼會是一堆魔族！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老比爾，你饒了我吧。指揮官在哪裡？我馬上去見她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行好。你覺得我有一絲當叛徒的可能性嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒沒有。這裡每個人都把你當家裡的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛讓你守在這，沒錯吧？你多叫幾個人，帶著我們一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，聽你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戰士比爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_403_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你們，別想輕舉妄動。我們會盯著你們的，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......阿米婭，我們好像前所未有地不受歡迎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我也感覺到了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"這合作有些艱難。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起了。大家平時不是這樣子的，只是對你們中某幾位的......樣貌有些神經過敏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等指揮官發話，肯定會好很多。跟我來吧，他們就在前面開會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們都沒聽見嗎？他們用城防炮轟炸了出入口！我們不能再繼續留在這裡！風險太大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的中年女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可要是離開薩迪恩區，我們就很難再回來救人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也想救他們。你以為我不想嗎？但你知道我們的人被關在哪裡？難道要我們的戰士走到薩卡茲面前一間屋子一間屋子找過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的中年女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特和洛洛他們一直在打探消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太慢了！情況有變，我們好不容易建起來的根據地，隨時都可能被薩卡茲轟成散沙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的中年女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"基地是死的，人是活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說得輕巧！反正一點點地把這地方建起來的人不是你們這些做生意的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他們似乎正在爭吵。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是有些小爭執。"}]},{"label":"我們來得是時候嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，指揮官不會介意。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們隊伍裡的人出身差別很大，有時候意見不統一，但大家的心是齊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且再怎麼吵，只要有指揮官在，最後都會有個結果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們都很信任她。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她真的這麼厲害？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......我們中的大多數都是她救的。要不是指揮官，我們都早就死在了薩卡茲或者深池的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像洛洛，他爸爸就因為不願意出賣城防軍的情報而被幾個雇傭兵活活打死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的話，我也不想給薩卡茲幹活，當初帶著幾個同事一起從西邊的海布里區一路逃過來，差點餓死在接駁管道裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後也是指揮官發現了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她把我們一個個地從絕境裡拉出來，並且把我們聚在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都很佩服她，也相信她能帶領我們渡過一個又一個絕境。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的青年男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，你說吧，我們該不該立刻轉移？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的中年女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，我建議我們馬上展開救援行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"其他七八個聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈默，泰勒，你們都冷靜一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間緊迫，爭執無益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聲音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼，大概是我的錯覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特先生，最後說話的人是你們的指揮官嗎？她聽起來......年紀很小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很意外是不是？我剛認識指揮官的時候，和你發出了一模一樣的感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得剛才嗎，卡特斯小姐，我第一眼看到你，就認出了你是領隊的那個。你很快就會知道這是為什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，見見我們的指揮官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諸位，你們各自的心情我都很理解。但是，有一點是不需要討論的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的人，我們一定會去救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倘若我們任由敵人傷害我們的戰士，之後還有誰會願意與我們並肩戰鬥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倘若我們任由敵人抓走我們的朋友，之後還有誰會願意向我們伸出援手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍。我們要拯救倫蒂尼姆，在這之前，我們必須救出那一個個我們熟悉的、活生生的人。"},{"type":"narration","text":"那雙抬起的手細瘦、小巧，堪稱稚嫩。但它似乎有著足夠的力量，能夠壓住即將沸騰的憤怒與焦灼。\n會議現場安靜了下來。\n人們的目光聚集在他們的指揮官身上，如此自然，就彷彿從未有人質疑過那瘦小的肩膀能否承受住這些沉甸甸的希望。\n這個畫面有些熟悉。\n許多羅德島幹員都冒出了這個想法。他們不約而同地看向了站在他們身前的卡特斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂費斯特的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，還真有點像，對吧對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我同意。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"還是不一樣。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家......小聲些，不要打擾他們開會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，在討論具體的救援方案之前，我們還需要見幾位新朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費斯特，請帶他們過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是，指揮官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們好，羅德島的各位，我一直在期待你們的到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫克洛維希婭，倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍的指揮官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g4_giantwall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲戰士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍，深池的指揮官到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蔓德拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德......將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你來找我，是有重要的事想與我們商談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......哼，你明明什麼都看見了，卻非得裝出這副樣子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是薩卡茲嗎？別的薩卡茲都不像你這麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會耍弄心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉女士，你剛才的言論，對薩卡茲來說已經算得上一種侮辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......隨你怎麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正......我是來道歉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？道歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前在下面的出入口，我們的人與你們之間產生了一些誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......來這裡，就是想再確認一次......我們之間的合作依然有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我不妨再提醒你一次。我們並沒有什麼實質性的合作條款需要遵守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池不干涉任何薩卡茲在倫蒂尼姆的行動，我們就容許你們在某一範圍內停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以把這當作我們之間的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某種默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說過的，我沒忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，忘了也沒關係。之前那番小小的動靜，就當作對你的提醒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感......謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別急著道謝。薩卡茲從來不像你們那樣容易忘事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想要我怎麼做？難道你想要我的命？你們真想這麼做的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想這麼做的話，你走不到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你甚至沒法走下幾個月前的西部大堂的臺階。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們想看見的，是深池的一點誠意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，不是從我們手裡搶走維多利亞士兵，或者綁架一兩個逃脫的倫蒂尼姆市民那種“誠意”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是時候展開一些......真正的合作了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想打擾你，但薩利他......他快支撐不住了！他那條傷腿已經腫得連膿水都擠不出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三隊回來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，今天上午外面很亂，他們可能耽擱得有點久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還有多少人手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上新來的，能戰鬥的還有十七個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊的留下，你們繼續負責警戒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶五個人出去，我們再去拜訪下深池借來的住處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......你又折回去的話，萬一撞上蔓德拉怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩利等不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他急需用藥。沒有鎮痛劑和消炎藥物的話，他甚至熬不過今天下午。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們誰身上還有值錢的東西？嗯？光是每天換來足夠的食物，都需要老艾頓絞盡腦汁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不去問深池要的話，難不成要去問薩卡茲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說......你們想去向平民伸手？如果他們出手幫了我們，敵人會怎麼對付他們，你們都想過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"垂頭喪氣可換不來戰友的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都收拾收拾，帶上能用的武器，我們立刻出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅本，你不是說沒殺夠嗎？你很幸運，瞧啊，機會這麼快又來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
